but after a moment of indecision

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:09.530
Krillin opted to spare the beautiful

00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:11.530
android and destroyed the best chance

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:13.130
he had of stopping Cell

00:02:13.130 --> 00:02:18.650
you shouldn't be here

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:21.770
look if Cell found you we'd all be doomed

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:23.140
please go

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:27.000
as Krillin's fit of compassion sealed

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.200
planet earth's fate and as if things

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:29.980
weren't bad enough

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.060
Cell has stumbled upon the alcove where the androids are hiding.

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:38.300
The scales of victory are tipping in Cell's favor.

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:41.580
Today on Dragon Ball Z.

00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:59.280
How would I have been searching for?

00:02:59.460 --> 00:02:59.900
Soon.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:02.230
18 you will be mine

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:08.870
Once I have absorbed her I will finally be complete

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:18.200
And then I can rule the world as the ultimate warrior an entity with no equal in power speed or ability

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:27.840
Oh, no

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:32.520
Krillin's with them. They haven't even noticed

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:43.630
we're up here. You could have

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:46.060
shut me down, but you didn't. What are you

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:48.460
trying to achieve? Well,

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:55.030
you see, uh, would you stop

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:57.230
looking at me with those puppy dog eyes?

00:03:59.060 --> 00:03:59.440
Huh?

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:02.740
