00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:09.280
And if that happens, the entire planet is doomed,

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:12.160
which means you have to get yourself out of here right now.

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:13.200
Huh?

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.340
Get out of here!

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:17.650
Cell knows where you are!

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:18.610
Huh?

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:20.240
Huh?

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:28.270
Huh?

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:29.350
No, no!

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:31.840
Why did you get her?

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:42.100
Who think Trunks wants to prove his powers like his dad?

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:29.960
you know what kind of

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.340
Vitamins Trunks is taking!

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:48.000
Mast is energy.

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:51.050
Krillin! Get the android out of here fast!

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:52.730
