00:05:59.280 --> 00:05:59.960
Right, let's...

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.640
Let's go, Sixteen. Hello, Sixteen?

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.890
Do not worry about me.

00:06:08.230 --> 00:06:11.700
