00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:13.930
Save yourself!

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:16.180
Well, I...

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:52.340
Fish boy, this is too good of an opportunity for you to ruin!

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:19.170
Nice to see you, 18.

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:34.180
From the looks of it, Sixteen, it appears that your batteries are running low.

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:42.950
Now, thanks to Vegeta, I will be able to reach the perfection that my creator intended.

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:46.230
Vegeta, I should have guessed.

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:49.360
Yes, he is a brave one.

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:52.320
Quite foolish, but brave nonetheless.

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:54.640
Hurry it up down there.

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:59.190
Would you just absorb the android and get on with it?

00:07:59.310 --> 00:07:59.970
I haven't got...

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:05.550
Stay back!

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:18.990
Vegeta.

