00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:45.790
Don't do it, father. Don't let him reach his final form.

00:09:47.740 --> 00:09:51.420
There's a good chance that he'll become stronger than the both of us.

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:56.860
But that's the thrill. Don't you want to see this power that he keeps on about?

00:09:57.930 --> 00:09:59.980
No, I've seen...

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:07.940
it all my life I've lived through the terrors of fiend like that creates and I

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:15.180
