00:10:24.230 --> 00:10:27.170
compassion will stop you that's what makes you weak

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:30.840
HAAA!

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:27.760
I'm sorry, Daddy. You probably just wish I wasn't even here, right, so I wouldn't slow you down so much.

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:29.980
Hey, you...

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:34.080
No, I'd never think something like that about my big, super cool son.

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:35.960
Right.

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:37.220
Good.

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:38.560
All right, Gohan.

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:42.400
Let's get you tucked in, and tomorrow we'll put in another hard day, okay?

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:43.500
Okay.

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:39.330
I've got to do something.

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:44.440
No, no, 18.

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:19.380
Not much time hurry up and get out of here liver

00:13:44.270 --> 00:13:46.860
B. I am done.

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:48.500
