00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:34.520
Hey, no!

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:19.560
Transformation has begun. Long last I will have a

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:43.180
For sure if I'm as powerful as my ancestors!

00:17:43.560 --> 00:17:46.640
