00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:31.440
The entire universe?

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:53.310
It's all my fault because I destroyed Bulma's remote!

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:04.060
Ha, ha, ha, ha.

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:10.260
It appears that Shell has finally succeeded in achieving his completed, heinous form.

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:14.600
But how will our Z fighters match up against this ultimate evil foe?

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:17.880
Are the Nameks right? Is the entire universe at risk?

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:21.820
Find out on the next episode of Dragon Ball Z.

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:23.400
Agh!

00:20:24.060 --> 00:20:25.740
Hi, everyone. This is Goku.

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:29.850
While I'm off working hard training Gohan to become a Super Saiyan.

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:34.020
The rest of the gang is battling Cell, who has finally become the ultimate android.

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:38.940
But do my pals stand half a chance against this transformed technological terror?

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:42.100
Well, let me put it to you this way, it sure doesn't look good!

00:20:42.570 --> 00:20:47.750
To find out who wins the next round, tune in to the next exciting episode of Dragon Ball Z!

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:49.880
